on capture into the mainstream when  he played Gollum in the Lord of the  Rings movies the transformation was  drastic but it was also controversial he  provided the voice movement and facial  expressions for Gollum but he was passed  over for awards because of the CGI since  then people have realized that mocap  acting is hard work and completely valid  Andy reprised his role as the ring  obsessed halfling in the hobbit  franchise he has also done motion  capture in the plan of the Apes movie  series but his performance as the sneaky  tormented Gollum is incredible seeing  him act out this character is creepy  even though he looks nothing like the  wide-eyed cave dweller Andy Serkis and  the Lord of the Rings effects team  revolutionized motion capture and  brought it to the mainstream  [Music]  that's a wrap now that you've seen these  actions without the digital effects tell  us which one made you laugh the most in  the comments thanks for watching please  subscribe to the things and give us a  big thumbs up so you'll never miss  another video see you next time  [Music]

